  "question": {
    "text": "The height of mercury barometer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> at sea level and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> at top of a hill. Ratio of density of mercury to that of air is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math>. the height of the hill is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
